{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUT, WHAT IS THIS THING ABOUT?...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pollo x la Pasta</strong> is a single-player basic strategy game where <strong>Don Ram\u00f3n</strong> and <strong>Perchita</strong> face off against the most dangerous gangsters in <strong>Chikenland</strong> on a\u00a0<strong>tic-tac-toe</strong> board with one goal: to score lines with their chickens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have a <strong>Half Chicken</strong>, a <strong>Cut Chicken</strong>, a <strong>Chicken</strong>, a <strong>Good Chicken</strong>, and a <strong>Pure Chicken</strong> to play with \u2014 use them to make the <strong>longest lines possible</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On two opposing boards, <strong>every move counts</strong>: if you place the same chicken in the same spot as your rival\u2026 <strong>their chicken goes flying!</strong><br>Earn more <i>leuros</i> than your opponent and move on to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054810/extras/d2a678208578a7c347fb6cd48127ea79.avif?t=1770652119\" width=1560 height=1625 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, to crush your enemies, you can grab all kinds of <i>Trukis</i> from the Shop, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Card:</strong>\u00a0Lowers the level of your rival\u2019s chickens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Straw:</strong>\u00a0Wipes out your opponent\u2019s lines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The JP Bottle:</strong> Messes with your rival\u2019s focus.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most illegal legal video game in history.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054810/extras/dffc554f8f9911bfb388c2f0e9fa5143.avif?t=1770652119\" width=902 height=737 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054810?t=1770652119","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054810/5b3d96daf05d286a0e7692fd352eaebbf284eaeb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770652119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054810/2dc2d8a927ae764973fdb6943928a5b1c9852fab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770652119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054810/2dc2d8a927ae764973fdb6943928a5b1c9852fab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770652119","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Chiken for Money is a satire about the drug world and its consequences. The game features profanity and foul language. It also makes indirect references to drugs."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUT, WHAT IS THIS THING ABOUT?...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pollo x la Pasta</strong> is a single-player basic strategy game where <strong>Don Ram\u00f3n</strong> and <strong>Perchita</strong> face off against the most dangerous gangsters in <strong>Chikenland</strong> on a\u00a0<strong>tic-tac-toe</strong> board with one goal: to score lines with their chickens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have a <strong>Half Chicken</strong>, a <strong>Cut Chicken</strong>, a <strong>Chicken</strong>, a <strong>Good Chicken</strong>, and a <strong>Pure Chicken</strong> to play with \u2014 use them to make the <strong>longest lines possible</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On two opposing boards, <strong>every move counts</strong>: if you place the same chicken in the same spot as your rival\u2026 <strong>their chicken goes flying!</strong><br>Earn more <i>leuros</i> than your opponent and move on to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054810/extras/d2a678208578a7c347fb6cd48127ea79.avif?t=1770652119\" width=1560 height=1625 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, to crush your enemies, you can grab all kinds of <i>Trukis</i> from the Shop, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Card:</strong>\u00a0Lowers the level of your rival\u2019s chickens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Straw:</strong>\u00a0Wipes out your opponent\u2019s lines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The JP Bottle:</strong> Messes with your rival\u2019s focus.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most illegal legal video game in history.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054810/extras/dffc554f8f9911bfb388c2f0e9fa5143.avif?t=1770652119\" width=902 height=737 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["TLR Games","Nikotxan"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054810/43c14f5977ce19dc896785c75392fa677aed58af/header.jpg?t=1770652119","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"d